Beat This!
----------

The beat and downbeat network embedded in beatgrid
(crates/beatgrid/models/student.safetensors) was distilled from the Beat This! `final0`
model: it was trained to reproduce that model's beat and downbeat outputs. Its input
features follow Beat This!'s. The research workspace (research/) depends on the beat-this
package.

  F. Foscarin, J. Schlüter and G. Widmer, "Beat this! Accurate beat tracking without DBN
  postprocessing", ISMIR 2024. https://github.com/CPJKU/beat_this

