Raveform
--------

The embedded network's downbeat (and, at lower weight, beat) outputs were also trained on
the expert-corrected beat grids of the Raveform dataset, converted to frame-wise targets for
the tracks where the labels match the audio (research/beatgrid_lab/student/labels.py).
Raveform is also one of the evaluation references. No Raveform labels or audio are
redistributed in this repository.

  Raveform, by Kim, Kim, Kim and Nam. Transactions of the International Society for Music
  Information Retrieval (TISMIR), 2026.
  https://mir-aidj.github.io/raveform/
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/taejunkim/raveform
  https://transactions.ismir.net/articles/10.5334/tismir.288

  Raveform's labels are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  license (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
